  "openDecisions": [
    "The relay change from PR #43 needs Khoa's review: publishing outside the transaction versus PR #43's transactional sweep with FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED. The trade-off is recorded under outboxRelayReconciliation.",
    "quizTestScoreSum is implemented as the sum of unrounded scorePercent (earned/max*100). The contract phrase 'unrounded point ratio' also permits a 0..1 ratio. Both Huy services share one convention; Khoa to confirm before any other caller reads the endpoint.",
    "averageProgressPercent keeps all Course Lessons as the denominator even under a levelId filter, following 'all Course Lessons' in the contract. If the team reads it as Lessons of that Level only, the formula changes.",
